The '''Observatory Dungeon''' leads from the [[Goblin settlement]] found north-east of the Observatory, to the [[Observatory]]. The dungeon is a giant maze, infested with low-levelled [[goblin]]s and a few high-levelled [[goblin guard]]s.
{{Map|x=2459|y=3184|mtype=square|align=left|caption=The entrance to the dungeon.}}

==Transportation==
* [[Ring of dueling]] or [[minigame teleport]] to [[Castle Wars]], then run north.
* [[Ourania Teleport]], then run south.

==Features==
This dungeon is used for the [[Observatory Quest]] and is also used to get to the Observatory for a [[Treasure Trail]]. It also contains various [[Chest (Observatory Dungeon)|chests]], with one [[Chest (Observatory Dungeon, antipoison)|specific chest]] containing an [[antipoison(1)]] potion.

